      9 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصفرّ</span></b>  <i>It become</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصْفَر</span> [i. e. <i>yellow:</i> and also
<i>black</i>]: (S, M, K:) and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصفارّ</span></b> : (S, K:) or the
former signifies <i>it was so constantly:</i> and the
latter, <i>it was so transiently.</i> (Az, TA. [See 9 in
art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حمر</span>.])

